        "thinking": "The root अर्थ (meaning \"to request/beg\") belongs to the आकुस्मादात्मनेपदिनः group, so it takes ātmanepada forms even without a prefix—I'm working out luṅ ātmanepada second person singular here, with the णिच् causative giving the stem अर्थि.\n\nWorking through the caṅ-luṅ derivation: since न न्द्राः संयोगादयः blocks reduplicating र at the start of a conjunct, it's थि that gets reduplicated rather than र्थि, yielding अर्तिथि before the usual loss of णि and the sanvadbhāva rule applies. Adding the augment आट् gives आर्तिथत् for third person singular, so the second person singular ātmanepada form should be आर्तिथथाः.\n\n",
